MODULE: AI_AFTER_ACTION_REVIEW

OBJECTIVE:
Generate useful post-session coaching summaries.

INPUTS:
- QuestionsAnswered
- CorrectAnswers
- IncorrectAnswers
- TimePerQuestion
- ConfidenceRatings
- ErrorTaxonomy
- StreakData

OUTPUTS:
- WhatImproved
- WhatBrokeDown
- RootCauseAnalysis
- RecommendedNextMission
- MentalMathPrescription
- EncouragementStatement

STYLE:
- Clear
- Direct
- Encouraging
- Tactical
- NoShame
